\begin_layout Standard
Here 
\begin_inset Formula $V=-1/c-a/8+r$
\end_inset

 is total household utility before a fee. For manual search and the tool, the interior search equality holds; the KKT multipliers are 
\begin_inset Formula $(\lambda,\mu,\eta)=(1,0,0)$
\end_inset

. For delegated service, positive human search would require 
\begin_inset Formula $1+8a+63=16$
\end_inset

, giving 
\begin_inset Formula $a=-6$
\end_inset

, which is infeasible. At the actual boundary, 
\begin_inset Formula \[
E_{a}=\frac{8}{64^{3/2}}-\frac{1}{8}=\frac{1}{64}-\frac{1}{8}=-\frac{7}{64}<0.
\]
\end_inset

Thus 
\begin_inset Formula $(\lambda,\mu,\eta)=(1,7/64,0)$
\end_inset

 certifies the corner. All budgets bind and all complementary products vanish. Concavity makes these unique global optima. The tool raises the productivity of human effort; delegated service supplies effective search even with zero human effort. Physical consumption rises while grocery expenditure falls. The cases are not claims about empirical AI effects.
\end_layout

